WEBVTT

00:04:28.196 --> 00:04:30.807
(Laughter)

00:04:31.172 --> 00:04:33.434
Dark chocolate,

00:04:33.458 --> 00:04:36.156
and a kid with legs up to my armpits.

00:04:36.546 --> 00:04:40.656
And the very first performance I had,
at the Judimar School of Dance,

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:45.109
was in a red checkered shirt,

00:04:45.133 --> 00:04:48.466
dungarees, pink ballet shoes,

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:53.101
and we were dancing to "I'm an Old Cowhand
from the Rio Grande."

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.990
I loved every minute of it.

00:04:56.014 --> 00:04:58.824
I mean, I literally did love
every minute of it,

00:04:58.848 --> 00:05:01.006
especially when I heard the applause,